# Emitted Messages

```block
node_modules/package-c/node_modules/biome-config-vodoo/biome.json configuration ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━

  × Biome resolved multiple versions of biome-config-vodoo.
  
  i This is an error for Biome because it doesn't know which version to use. Extended configurations are applied in order, and a fixed configuration could be overridden by one that is bugged.
  
  i The first reference from node_modules/package-b/biome.json resolves to node_modules/package-b/node_modules/biome-config-vodoo/biome.json from biome-config-vodoo@0.2.0.
  
  i The conflicting reference from node_modules/package-c/biome.json resolves to node_modules/package-c/node_modules/biome-config-vodoo/biome.json from biome-config-vodoo@0.5.0.
  
  i Biome can't determine which configuration should be used.
  

```
